# Per-project build output (source and manifests remain tracked)
**/out/
**/dist/
**/.remotion/
**/coverage/
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/public/score.wav
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wav

# New third-party raw source downloads: record source URL/hash instead.
# Already tracked source files are unaffected by .gitignore and must be reviewed separately.
**/data/sources/*.zip
**/data/sources/*.pdf
**/data/sources/*.docx
**/data/sources/*.xls
**/data/sources/*.xlsx
